# Windows dev

Read `.kiro/steering/windows-dev.md`.

- Browser and probes use `http://localhost:8090`, not raw service ports.
- Stale data on localhost often means `wslrelay` — run `wsl --shutdown` then recreate compose stack.
- Codegraph venv is WSL/Linux — use `make codegraph` or `scripts/codegraph-mcp.ps1`.
- After `.env` token changes: `--force-recreate` affected containers (clipper, chat, metadata).
